    kind: invariant  # ce9d
    title: "IoPrimitive.kind is written under three rules — the callee's construct (rust), whether a VALUE supplies its owner (python/cpp/scala/WI-komun), and what the analyzer stamps (java/kotlin) — and every consumer that branches on it needs the second"  # ce9d
    status: violated  # ce9d
    priority: 2  # ce9d
